0
00:00:01,568 --> 00:00:04,304
>> Tyra: PREVIOUSLY
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"

1
00:00:04,304 --> 00:00:05,973
THE HARSH REALITY
OF THE MODELING WORLD

2
00:00:05,973 --> 00:00:08,408
OVERWHELMED CATIE
AND SPARKED A RIVALRY

3
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:10,344
BETWEEN YOANNA AND CAMILLE...

4
00:00:10,344 --> 00:00:11,245
Camille: IF I HAVE SOMETHING
TO SAY TO YOU,

5
00:00:11,245 --> 00:00:12,913
I WILL SAY IT TO YOUR FACE.

6
00:00:12,913 --> 00:00:15,349
>> Tyra: WHILE SARA FACED
HER FATHER'S DISAPPROVAL.

7
00:00:15,349 --> 00:00:16,950
Sara: HE CONSIDERS MODELING
PROSTITUTION.

8
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,452
>> Tyra: AND IN
THE LAST ELIMINATION,

9
00:00:18,452 --> 00:00:20,821
XIOMARA WAS SENT HOME.

10
00:00:20,821 --> 00:00:22,589
SEVEN GIRLS REMAIN.

11
00:00:22,589 --> 00:00:23,757
WHO WILL BE
ELIMINATED TONIGHT?

12
00:00:25,325 --> 00:00:27,361
♪♪♪

13
00:01:01,261 --> 00:01:02,996
Catie: AT LAST JUDGING,
WHEN IT WAS YOU

14
00:01:02,996 --> 00:01:04,798
AND XIOMARA UP THERE,
DID YOU THINK

15
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:07,534
SHE WAS GOING HOME,
OR YOU WERE GOING HOME?

16
00:01:07,534 --> 00:01:08,769
Camille: I'M NOT--
I WASN'T GOING HOME.

17
00:01:08,769 --> 00:01:10,003
I WAS JUST CHILLING.

18
00:01:10,003 --> 00:01:11,505
I WASN'T NERVOUS.

19
00:01:11,505 --> 00:01:14,007
Tyra: CAMILLE,
CONGRATULATIONS.

20
00:01:14,007 --> 00:01:16,643
Catie: CAMILLE IS
AN INCREDIBLY STRONG WOMAN.

21
00:01:16,643 --> 00:01:20,013
SHE HAS NO VULNERABILITY
AND SHOWS NO EMOTIONS,

22
00:01:20,013 --> 00:01:21,915
HAPPY NOR SAD.

23
00:01:21,915 --> 00:01:23,717
SHE'S ALWAYS JUST MEDIUM.

24
00:01:23,717 --> 00:01:24,885
BE HONEST--
WHAT ONE DID YOU LIKE BETTER,

25
00:01:24,885 --> 00:01:26,787
LONG HAIR OR SHORT HAIR?

26
00:01:26,787 --> 00:01:28,655
Camille: I THINK
THAT WITH YOUR SHORT HAIR,

27
00:01:28,655 --> 00:01:30,591
YOU CAN DO SOME
FUNKY THINGS WITH IT.

28
00:01:30,591 --> 00:01:32,593
YOU JUST HAVE TO PLAY WITH IT.

29
00:01:32,593 --> 00:01:33,994
Catie: WELL,
WHAT MY PROBLEM IS

30
00:01:33,994 --> 00:01:38,699
IS I'M TRYING TO CHANGE WHO I AM
FOR THE JUDGES TO LIKE ME.

31
00:01:38,699 --> 00:01:39,666
I THINK IT REALLY SUCKS.

32
00:01:44,171 --> 00:01:45,505
Camille: SALUD!

33
00:01:45,505 --> 00:01:46,506
SALUD.

34
00:01:46,506 --> 00:01:47,741
Sara: SALUD.

35
00:01:47,741 --> 00:01:48,842
Mercedes: OH,
MINE'S WAY BIGGER.

36
00:01:48,842 --> 00:01:50,143
April: MINE'S WAY BIGGER.

37
00:01:50,143 --> 00:01:51,945
Mercedes: NO, MINE ACTUALLY
GOES OVER MY STOMACH.

38
00:01:55,482 --> 00:01:57,918
April: THAT'S A BELLY!

39
00:01:57,918 --> 00:02:00,320
Mercedes: MY BELLY
SURPASSES YOURS.

40
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,556
April: SIX-PACK--GONE.

41
00:02:02,556 --> 00:02:03,890
Mercedes: IT LOOKS
