YOUR HAMBURGERS.

48
00:02:11,198 --> 00:02:14,001
Catie: I WAS JUST SAYING--
I DIDN'T MEAN IT IN A RUDE WAY.

49
00:02:14,001 --> 00:02:15,502
I WAS JUST SAYING, YOU KNOW...

50
00:02:15,502 --> 00:02:16,236
NO, BUT YOU GUYS
DO IT TO ME A LOT.

51
00:02:16,236 --> 00:02:17,738
Mercedes: CATIE--

52
00:02:17,738 --> 00:02:18,872
SHE'S GETTING
TOO SENSITIVE FOR ME.

53
00:02:18,872 --> 00:02:20,607
IT'S JUST, LIKE, "SHUT UP!

54
00:02:20,607 --> 00:02:22,476
SHUT UP! SHUT UP! SHUT UP!"

55
00:02:22,476 --> 00:02:24,544
Catie: IT WAS
SUPPOSED TO BE A JOKE.

56
00:02:30,717 --> 00:02:32,719
Yoanna: GUYS,
THERE'S TYRA MAIL!

57
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:35,155
"THE WORLD IS FULL OF COLOR,
BUT SOMETIMES IT'S SEEN BEST

58
00:02:35,155 --> 00:02:36,923
IN BLACK AND WHITE."

59
00:02:36,923 --> 00:02:38,258
WE HAVE TO PREPARE FOR A
BLACK-AND-WHITE PHOTO SHOOT,

60
00:02:38,258 --> 00:02:39,726
WHICH I THOUGHT IS SO GREAT.

61
00:02:39,726 --> 00:02:40,927
CLASSIC! GET READY.

62
00:02:40,927 --> 00:02:41,928
Shandi: RIGHT NOW!

63
00:02:41,928 --> 00:02:43,196
RIGHT NOW!

64
00:02:43,196 --> 00:02:44,898
Camille: I WOKE UP
THIS MORNING, AND I DON'T KNOW

65
00:02:44,898 --> 00:02:48,001
WHAT'S GOING ON, BUT MY MOUTH
WAS LIKE SUPER, SUPER-SWOLLEN,

66
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:49,703
AND IT HURT.

67
00:02:49,703 --> 00:02:53,473
IT'S JUST GETTING WORSE,
LIKE IT'S JUST GETTING TIGHTER.

68
00:02:53,473 --> 00:02:54,474
LIKE,
IT'S HARDER FOR ME TO TALK,

69
00:02:54,474 --> 00:02:55,776
'CAUSE IT'S IN THE CORNERS.

70
00:02:55,776 --> 00:02:57,210
April: IS IT THIS WHOLE AREA,
