REACTION TO SOMETHING.

74
00:03:03,684 --> 00:03:04,951
SHE'S PROBABLY
FEELING SELF-CONSCIOUS.

75
00:03:09,723 --> 00:03:13,093
Camille: BUT IT JUST, LIKE--
I DON'T HAVE BIG LIPS,

76
00:03:13,093 --> 00:03:14,261
BUT IT'S JUST BIGGER.

77
00:03:14,261 --> 00:03:15,762
