90
00:03:47,627 --> 00:03:48,228
'CAUSE YOU FEEL
LIKE YOU'RE HAVING

91
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:49,863
AN ALLERGIC REACTION TODAY.

92
00:03:49,863 --> 00:03:51,832
