TOTALLY REAM YOU EITHER.

125
00:05:08,842 --> 00:05:09,843
April: I KNOW.

126
00:05:09,843 --> 00:05:11,511
I'M SO SENSITIVE. I KNOW.

127
00:05:11,511 --> 00:05:12,813
Mercedes: YOU ARE.

128
00:05:12,813 --> 00:05:14,114
