129
00:05:14,114 --> 00:05:15,215
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?

130
00:05:15,215 --> 00:05:16,483
April: IT'S PERSONALITY, TOO.

131
00:05:16,483 --> 00:05:17,484
Mercedes: BUT YOU HAVE
A PERSONALITY.

132
00:05:17,484 --> 00:05:19,019
IT'S NOT LIKE YOU'RE A DRONE.

133
00:05:19,019 --> 00:05:21,621
