"YOU KNOW WHAT, APRIL?

141
00:05:37,637 --> 00:05:39,639
YOU GAVE US
FLAWLESS PHOTOGRAPHS,

142
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:42,709
BUT YOU DIDN'T STEP IT UP
