197
00:07:37,724 --> 00:07:40,226
April: I LOVE ACTING CLASS.

198
00:07:40,226 --> 00:07:42,195
Camille: MY MOUTH RIGHT NOW
IS, LIKE...

199
00:07:42,195 --> 00:07:43,897
