335
00:12:50,937 --> 00:12:52,171
Tasha: COME ON!

336
00:12:52,171 --> 00:12:53,740
YOU'RE SUCKING RIGHT NOW!

337
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:55,174
Yoanna: I WAS ALMOST WISHING
