341
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,749
Tasha: I JUST FEEL LIKE
YOU'RE STILL ON THE SURFACE.

342
00:13:02,749 --> 00:13:05,118
THERE'S STUFF INSIDE YOUR HEART
