344
00:13:06,653 --> 00:13:07,654
Camille: I'M TRYING HERE.

345
00:13:07,654 --> 00:13:09,255
I'M TRYING!
Tasha: I JUST--I DO.

346
00:13:09,255 --> 00:13:12,925
I FEEL LIKE YOU JUST WANNA HAVE
THIS PERFECT MASK ON.

347
00:13:12,925 --> 00:13:14,927
Camille: IT HAS TO DO
WITH ME, INSIDE OF ME.

348
00:13:14,927 --> 00:13:16,863
Tasha: BUT GOD BLESS YOU
IN YOUR CAREER,

349
00:13:16,863 --> 00:13:18,598
BUT YOU'RE JUST BORING.

350
00:13:18,598 --> 00:13:20,199
Camille: I'M SITTING UP THERE
WITH YOANNA, 'CAUSE I'M COMING

351
00:13:20,199 --> 00:13:22,735
INTO THIS NEW SITUATION NOW,
MISSED THE FIRST HALF

352
00:13:22,735 --> 00:13:25,638
