MY MOUTH IS THE SIZE

353
00:13:25,638 --> 00:13:29,008
OF A FRICKIN' WATERMELON,
AND I WAS JUST LIKE...

354
00:13:29,008 --> 00:13:30,610
OKAY.

355
00:13:30,610 --> 00:13:32,912
