AFFECTED BY WAS CAMILLE.

360
00:13:44,657 --> 00:13:45,758
Camille: I KNOW
IT'S A COMPETITION,

361
00:13:45,758 --> 00:13:48,728
AND WE HAVE TO DO THIS
IN ORDER TO WIN,

362
00:13:48,728 --> 00:13:50,697
AND SO WE HAVE TO GET
INTO THIS ACTING ROLE.

363
00:13:50,697 --> 00:13:51,698
IT'S JUST GONNA BE
VERY DIFFICULT.

364
00:13:51,698 --> 00:13:53,566
THAT JUST MIGHT BE MY DOWNFALL.

365
00:13:59,805 --> 00:14:02,174
Sara: THE ACTING DAY
WRAPS UP WITH EVERYBODY JUST

366
00:14:02,174 --> 00:14:04,610
REALLY EMOTIONALLY DRAINED.

367
00:14:04,610 --> 00:14:06,511
Camille: I DIDN'T SEEM
EMOTIONAL?

368
00:14:06,511 --> 00:14:08,480
April: NOT REALLY.
Sara: MNH-MNH.

369
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,148
Camille: LIKE, I'VE NEVER
SEEN MY GRANDMOTHER CRY.

370
00:14:10,148 --> 00:14:11,149
I'VE NEVER SEEN MY MOTHER CRY.

371
00:14:11,149 --> 00:14:11,950
I'VE NEVER SEEN
MY FATHER CRY.

372
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:13,785
April: MM-HMM.

373
00:14:13,785 --> 00:14:14,820
