(dramatic voice) "I REMEMBER
YOUR FUNERAL

398
00:14:54,026 --> 00:14:55,427
LIKE IT WAS YESTERDAY."

399
00:14:55,427 --> 00:14:56,595
(normal voice) YOU WOULD SAY,
"I REMEMBER

400
00:14:56,595 --> 00:14:58,830
THE MILITARY FUNERAL
LIKE IT WAS YESTERDAY."

