407
00:15:12,611 --> 00:15:13,845
April: "IS IT DIFFICULT
FOR YOU?"

408
00:15:13,845 --> 00:15:15,814
Mercedes: APRIL--
SHE'S THE ONLY ONE IN THE HOUSE

