WHOLE SPIEL ABOUT REMEMBERING

424
00:15:45,477 --> 00:15:47,012
THE MILITARY FUNERAL?

425
00:15:47,012 --> 00:15:48,413
April: MM-HMM.
Catie: OH, GOOD GRAVY.

426
00:15:48,413 --> 00:15:49,548
I HAVEN'T.

427
00:15:51,850 --> 00:15:54,052
Tasha: HI, GORGEOUS LADIES.
Women: HELLO.

428
00:15:54,052 --> 00:15:56,388
Tasha: SO TODAY IS TEST DAY.

429
00:15:56,388 --> 00:15:59,658
I GET TO PICK AND CHOOSE
WHO'S GONNA WIN

430
00:15:59,658 --> 00:16:02,995
A FABULOUS SHOPPING SPREE TODAY
