437
00:16:19,644 --> 00:16:21,947
THIS LITTLE GIDDY GRIN
ON SHANDI'S FACE,

438
00:16:21,947 --> 00:16:25,017
AND SHE WAS EXCITED TO, LIKE,
PROCEED WITH THE SCENE.

439
00:16:25,017 --> 00:16:26,952
Tasha: ANYTHING YOU WANNA SAY
